{"v":4,"catch":"感受速度，寫下傳奇。","desc":"《Formula 2025：Grand Prix Legends》 是一款將未來風格與經典方程式賽車精神結合的高速單人賽車模擬遊戲。在世界各地的賽道上競速，掌握急轉彎技巧，升級你的賽車，引領排行榜頂端。憑藉逼真的物理引擎與動態賽道環境，每一圈都充滿刺激與成就感。\n\n升級車輛、打破計時賽紀錄、解鎖讓人聯想到傳奇大獎賽的經典賽道。無論是挑戰完美單圈還是超越對手奔馳前方，Formula 2025 都能在無需線上對戰的情況下，帶來純粹的競速快感。","publisher":"Eclipse Interactive","release":"2025-05-29","genres":["競速","模擬","策略"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.6GB / Switch 0.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/08fa44430035062f27460c55b3290ecdde2e49cfac3b95aa4a27eb4ffb41df22.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a29c51db7ea3a5094ef64cbab27eb81646c2302bc70f11a52712a8e38e3952f2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/73cba24efe9a2bb2b95d0208d3f5030ac23902ea6318119935211976341d6cd2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aa6e6857666ce92a3191f4fe6bdcc05ac928112bce06eeb9646508eb0e58f561.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/892be3c91d88ba0f5899a3dd41c84ab4b7bca6c95d174840ba819fa58c5d17b0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4b5ca74163d46cba665b4599407b6d94f416cdf9fb197b9afe1a9b4857ae3d16.jpg"],"titleId":"01008c902375a000","dlc":[]}